WEBVTT

00:12.660 --> 00:24.420
CHILLIN' IN ANOTHER WORLD
WITH LV2 SUPER CHEAT POWERS

01:33.530 --> 01:34.160
#12 STEAMY HOT SPRING TRIP PART TWO

01:34.160 --> 01:35.510
#12 STEAMY HOT SPRING TRIP PART TWO
That is...

01:35.510 --> 01:36.160
#12 STEAMY HOT SPRING TRIP PART TWO

01:39.850 --> 01:41.960
I'm going to tell Sir Flio.

01:42.330 --> 01:45.590
Okay! We will evacuate the people.

01:45.590 --> 01:46.350
Same here.

02:00.020 --> 02:02.770
Let's party!

02:30.970 --> 02:32.070
Sir Flio!

02:32.930 --> 02:33.970
Balirossa!

02:34.390 --> 02:35.300
Is everyone okay?

02:35.300 --> 02:35.930
Yes.

02:36.390 --> 02:39.140
A monster suddenly appeared
and went berserk.

02:39.560 --> 02:40.470
A monster?

02:40.770 --> 02:45.190
It seems that the current Dark One, Yuigarde,
and his subordinates were among the guests.

02:46.150 --> 02:51.730
On the way here, I saw Ghozal with
somebody who looked like a demon.

02:51.730 --> 02:54.710
I wonder if they are colluding
with each other.

02:55.280 --> 02:57.200
I don't think so.

02:57.200 --> 03:00.100
And you don't either.
Do you, Balirossa?

03:02.510 --> 03:04.710
I have no worries if Ghozal is there.

03:04.710 --> 03:07.540
I'm going to focus on protecting
the inn building.

03:33.570 --> 03:36.900
Yuigarde's ability to control Malicium
is really bothersome.

03:37.320 --> 03:39.660
He's even trying to control mine, too.

03:39.660 --> 03:41.370
That's really annoying!

03:42.620 --> 03:45.870
It looks like there are humans
inside that gem.

03:45.870 --> 03:47.790
Leave them to me.

03:48.330 --> 03:54.840
How dare they interfere with
my hot spring trip with my dear!

03:55.340 --> 03:57.050
Short Distance Teleportation!

03:59.970 --> 04:01.600
Heaven punishment!

04:04.640 --> 04:06.730
Sir Hero!

04:18.860 --> 04:22.200
I made a promise not to cause
any harm to humans, after all.

04:22.200 --> 04:24.610
What a bunch of crap!

04:28.750 --> 04:30.120
Lord Yuigarde!

04:30.120 --> 04:33.480
Uliminas, deal with the others.

04:35.920 --> 04:39.930
Yuigarde, let me ask you.
Are you not going to back down?

04:40.330 --> 04:41.840
Of course not.

04:41.840 --> 04:44.510
Eating, drinking, and rampaging
as much as we want.

04:44.870 --> 04:48.230
I'll live by my own instincts.
That's us, the demons.

04:48.230 --> 04:51.900
There's nothing more fun than that!

04:58.650 --> 05:00.530
Don't look away.

05:05.450 --> 05:11.460
Now that you're the Dark One, you should
be more aware of your surroundings.

05:12.830 --> 05:16.010
Shut up!

05:17.710 --> 05:22.010
What are you guys doing here
with Yuigarde?

05:22.010 --> 05:26.510
Well, we're here just to enjoy
the hot springs.

05:26.510 --> 05:28.520
We have no intention to fight.

05:28.520 --> 05:31.270
If you ask me, just let them fight.

05:31.270 --> 05:33.980
This cat is really an eyesore.

05:34.420 --> 05:37.190
I won't let you get in Lord Yuigarde's way!

05:37.190 --> 05:40.400
Which one is getting in the way?!
You perverted four-eyes!

05:55.500 --> 05:58.090
Reflection magic, huh?

05:58.090 --> 06:02.470
But you're still getting hit.

06:02.470 --> 06:06.510
Alright then, reflect all the attacks
as many as you want!

06:08.760 --> 06:10.850
Soft, soft, you're too soft!

06:10.850 --> 06:14.810
You've even lost your natural aggression
because of your stupid pacifism!

06:14.810 --> 06:17.820
It's not like you to be on the defensive!

06:20.860 --> 06:22.360
Are you done yet?

06:22.360 --> 06:24.030
Let's have more fun!

06:24.430 --> 06:26.120
Just like in the old days—

06:26.120 --> 06:29.120
I never wanted to use this again.

06:29.410 --> 06:31.200
Forgive me, Yuigarde.

06:38.750 --> 06:39.840
What?

06:40.210 --> 06:41.800
I can't use Malicium?!

06:42.230 --> 06:44.300
I shut down your Malicium temporarily.

06:44.880 --> 06:48.600
Malicium is the source of
the demons' strength.

06:49.190 --> 06:52.430
Right now, you're basically
the same as a human.

06:52.430 --> 06:54.110
What does that mean?!

06:54.110 --> 06:55.850
I never heard a spell that can do that!

06:56.480 --> 06:59.940
I perfected that spell to kill
the previous Dark One.

06:59.940 --> 07:03.490
It was originally a spell
that the humans researched.

07:03.490 --> 07:05.150
W-What did you say?!

07:05.150 --> 07:08.450
The previous Dark One was
too hasty to stomp them out.

07:08.450 --> 07:13.000
They may destroy us one day if we were
trying to force them into submission.

07:13.000 --> 07:15.750
The pathetic humans' spell?

07:15.750 --> 07:17.960
How far are you going to mock me?!

07:18.390 --> 07:19.840
Ma'am!

07:20.750 --> 07:23.550
There's no other choice
than to use this.

07:30.550 --> 07:32.600
Take this!

07:33.850 --> 07:35.980
Huh? What is this?

07:44.900 --> 07:47.910
I can't muster any strength!

07:49.620 --> 07:52.830
Huh? What's going on?

07:52.830 --> 07:58.750
We put a spell on the guests' yukatas
in case of emergency.

07:59.130 --> 08:04.590
As you've disturbed our other guests,
we have to ask you to leave!

08:06.380 --> 08:08.180
I won't forgive you, Gholl!

08:08.180 --> 08:11.640
You better remember this!

08:14.450 --> 08:16.100
That was fast.

08:16.100 --> 08:18.310
We're sorry!

08:19.770 --> 08:23.360
He's not actually wanting
to turn into that either!

08:23.360 --> 08:26.360
Rys, that's enough!

08:26.360 --> 08:31.120
No way. I'm just making sure
that all the Malicium has left his body.

08:31.120 --> 08:32.830
Lady Rys!

08:32.830 --> 08:37.580
Sir Flio needs everyone out of the building,
so he can restore the building.

08:37.580 --> 08:39.250
My dear husband asked that?

08:42.169 --> 08:47.720
Please hang in there, Sir Hero!

09:13.910 --> 09:16.160
Come back here!

09:23.540 --> 09:27.250
I didn't expect that we'd be back
in working so soon.

09:27.250 --> 09:30.220
We can't possibly thank you enough.

09:30.560 --> 09:32.930
Thank you so much!

09:33.450 --> 09:35.810
I'm just glad I could help.

09:36.350 --> 09:38.890
Thank goodness that everyone's okay.

09:39.430 --> 09:42.770
- I must apologize for my—
- Don't say anything!

09:43.270 --> 09:46.860
Please enjoy our hot springs
to the fullest.

09:46.860 --> 09:51.240
Our entire staff will be fully
committed to servicing you!

09:51.240 --> 09:54.200
All the nuisances are finally gone!

09:54.200 --> 09:59.160
Now we can finally soak
in the Yanagi Spring!

10:07.250 --> 10:09.840
Me and my dear's pups...

10:14.260 --> 10:17.300
What's wrong, Uliminas?
Aren't you soaking in?

10:17.300 --> 10:18.010
Meow?!

10:18.010 --> 10:20.350
Could it be that you're afraid of hot water?

10:20.350 --> 10:22.480
I'm not a scaredy-cat!

10:23.190 --> 10:24.940
Ouch! It's hot!

10:24.940 --> 10:26.730
Meow?

10:29.150 --> 10:31.900
It's not as bad as I thought.

10:33.700 --> 10:35.990
You finally understand
the good of a hot spring.

10:35.990 --> 10:40.330
This woman is amazing
when she's naked.

10:43.000 --> 10:46.670
What?! These aren't things
that you need to look at!

10:50.000 --> 10:52.130
It feels good.

10:52.130 --> 10:54.470
I still do not understand.

10:54.470 --> 10:56.640
Hey, you perverted djinn.

10:56.640 --> 10:59.390
What the hell are you doing
in a women's bath?

10:59.390 --> 11:03.730
Oh my, Damalynas.
Are you jealous?

11:03.730 --> 11:07.230
Like hell! You pervert!
Don't enter the women's bath!

11:07.730 --> 11:11.730
Let us have some intimate moments
alone together after this.

11:11.730 --> 11:13.610
That's not what I meant!

11:13.610 --> 11:15.200
- Are you even listening?!
- Where'd you two go

11:15.200 --> 11:16.660
- Are you even listening?!
- during all the commotion?

11:16.660 --> 11:18.320
W-Well...

11:18.820 --> 11:23.540
We were spending some
intimate moments together.

11:23.540 --> 11:26.750
Don't make it sound weird!

11:26.750 --> 11:29.710
Oh, what an odd reaction.

11:29.710 --> 11:31.300
What were you doing?

11:31.300 --> 11:32.710
Explain, or else...

11:32.710 --> 11:34.630
Take this!

11:34.630 --> 11:36.180
Stop it!

11:39.140 --> 11:40.430
It's lively, isn't it?

11:41.560 --> 11:43.890
I'm glad that they're getting along.

11:44.300 --> 11:47.100
I guess it must be the power
of the hot springs.

11:47.100 --> 11:51.150
I feel relaxed and at ease here.

11:52.980 --> 11:57.490
Still, I never thought I'd see the day
when I'd be in a hot spring with you.

11:57.490 --> 11:59.110
You're right.

11:59.110 --> 12:04.700
But I have been interested in you,
ever since we first met.

12:04.700 --> 12:05.660
Huh?

12:05.660 --> 12:07.080
I don't mean that in a weird way.

12:07.540 --> 12:09.290
I know.

12:10.130 --> 12:14.130
You possess the fortitude
to stand tall in front of me.

12:14.840 --> 12:18.130
You use your great power,
not for personal gain,

12:18.130 --> 12:22.010
but for the peace between
the demons and the humans.

12:22.850 --> 12:28.770
If we join hands, perhaps we can build
a new relationship between the two races.

12:29.440 --> 12:31.230
That's what I thought.

12:31.860 --> 12:33.940
You're overestimating me.

12:34.360 --> 12:38.030
I might have tremendous power.

12:38.610 --> 12:43.580
There is no magic anywhere
that can eliminate conflict from this world.

12:44.450 --> 12:47.660
Relying on magic alone
won't change anything.

12:48.030 --> 12:50.250
So, how do we change that?

12:52.460 --> 12:53.650
I don't know.

12:54.290 --> 12:59.090
But, I'm able to find friends
that I can rely on in this world.

12:59.590 --> 13:04.140
With their help, I think I can try
to do what I can do here.

13:07.980 --> 13:10.890
There may be something I can help.

13:10.890 --> 13:13.440
As one of your friends.

13:18.820 --> 13:19.780
Wow!

13:19.780 --> 13:21.360
What a feast!

13:21.360 --> 13:24.700
Please eat as much as you want!
There are more will be coming!

13:24.700 --> 13:26.730
Time to dig in!

13:27.200 --> 13:28.450
Time to dig in.

13:30.790 --> 13:34.420
This is our little gift to you.

13:35.340 --> 13:37.880
It is eel wrapped in pie.

13:38.280 --> 13:39.800
It'll give you energy.

13:44.260 --> 13:46.600
These fish are so delicious!

13:46.600 --> 13:48.560
This sake is also good.

13:48.560 --> 13:50.980
Gho-Ghozal...

13:52.230 --> 13:55.690
You rarely come to me first.

13:55.690 --> 13:57.360
Is there something that I can help?

13:57.360 --> 13:59.740
Thank you for your help earlier.

14:00.940 --> 14:03.200
I heard it from Lady Rys.

14:03.200 --> 14:07.410
You used your power to protect
humans from being hurt.

14:07.410 --> 14:11.750
I don't want to break my promise to you.

14:14.000 --> 14:18.670
You two! Don't create
a good mood by yourselves!

14:20.880 --> 14:25.340
Thank you!
The next song will be...

14:28.470 --> 14:31.730
Hey, Belano!
Wait, there are two Belanos?

14:31.730 --> 14:36.230
Are you making a clone?
Magic these days is so great!

14:49.700 --> 14:52.080
I can still drink.

14:57.420 --> 14:59.670
They're all sleeping.

14:59.670 --> 15:02.260
Well, so many things happened today.

15:05.760 --> 15:09.510
We're finally alone.

15:11.470 --> 15:16.060
So, what do you think about humans now?

15:16.470 --> 15:17.600
Well...

15:17.600 --> 15:20.270
Let me think.

15:21.280 --> 15:26.240
They're weak compared to lupines.

15:27.450 --> 15:35.710
But, there's more to them,
than how strong they are in battle.

15:36.290 --> 15:38.250
I still remember it even now.

15:41.340 --> 15:46.390
When I feel defeated after tasting
Balirossa's cake that day.

15:47.030 --> 15:50.260
"How are you able to make it fluffy?"
like that.

15:53.060 --> 15:57.350
It's hard to say when you asked about
what I think about humans.

15:57.350 --> 16:00.650
But now, I don't think they're my enemy.

16:00.650 --> 16:04.190
In fact, I find them quite endearing.

16:04.740 --> 16:05.900
Is that so?

16:05.900 --> 16:08.990
But why did you ask?

16:09.570 --> 16:12.740
I wanted to know how you feel.

16:13.200 --> 16:17.320
Since I think the conflicts between
two races could get more intense.

16:17.820 --> 16:23.340
That's why I think I'll keep defending
their towns to prevent any casualties.

16:23.880 --> 16:27.550
Rys, I'd like your help with that.

16:28.050 --> 16:29.550
My dear...

16:35.020 --> 16:40.020
So that I don't go too far or start
favoring the humans too much.

16:40.020 --> 16:46.610
With you on my side,
I know I'll stay on the right path.

16:49.610 --> 16:54.160
I'll go anywhere with you, Dear.

16:54.160 --> 16:57.450
I'm your wife after all.

16:57.450 --> 16:58.080
And also...!

16:58.990 --> 17:00.370
Rys?

17:00.370 --> 17:04.960
We need to make this world safe
for our pups!

17:04.960 --> 17:06.130
Rys...

17:26.609 --> 17:28.400
My dear...

17:40.330 --> 17:43.080
It was a very enjoyable trip!

17:43.540 --> 17:46.000
You seem to be very happy.

17:46.000 --> 17:48.340
Your skin looks so shiny too.

17:48.340 --> 17:49.670
Don't tell me, last night...

17:53.300 --> 17:56.010
It is frustrating that
I was unable to observe them.

17:56.410 --> 17:57.510
What happened?

17:57.510 --> 17:59.850
No need for you to understand!

18:03.980 --> 18:05.690
All right, let's go home!

18:17.660 --> 18:19.240
Thank you, Sybe.

18:19.700 --> 18:22.830
Today is the first day Belano
teaching in a class.

18:22.830 --> 18:26.840
I want to feed her tasty veggies
when she comes home.

18:28.670 --> 18:34.970
My magic is not much, and the number
of spells that I can use is limited.

18:34.970 --> 18:40.520
But there are people who have
taught me various spells.

18:41.600 --> 18:46.230
I'm going to teach you, one by one,
the things that I learned from them.

18:51.400 --> 18:53.400
It seems to be growing well.

18:53.990 --> 18:55.860
Please try it.

18:55.860 --> 18:57.160
Okay, let's try...

19:01.590 --> 19:02.380
It's good!

19:02.380 --> 19:05.290
Raising vegetables by magic can
make them this delicious as well.

19:08.460 --> 19:12.130
The people in town will
be happy with this.

19:12.130 --> 19:14.130
That is good to hear.

19:15.380 --> 19:21.060
Please leave it to me and the horses
for the delivery.

19:23.480 --> 19:25.020
This is kinda difficult.

19:25.020 --> 19:27.350
Really? Rather, I think you're good at this.

19:27.350 --> 19:30.070
What are you doing?

19:30.070 --> 19:31.820
Are you trying to open a weapon store?

19:31.820 --> 19:33.400
That's a great idea.

19:33.400 --> 19:35.070
There's no way it is!

19:35.070 --> 19:39.990
Humans can't use weapons or armor
created by the former Dark One!

19:39.990 --> 19:43.080
How was the hunt, Balirossa?

19:43.080 --> 19:44.330
It went well.

19:44.780 --> 19:47.790
The shield that you created
really helped.

19:47.790 --> 19:49.130
That's good to know.

19:50.540 --> 19:54.880
Anyway, Sir Flio!
Today is the Princess's inauguration.

19:55.340 --> 19:58.640
Yeah. I think the Castle Town
is very busy right now.

19:59.050 --> 20:02.850
I hope the Dark Army isn't going
to invade during this time.

20:02.850 --> 20:05.100
Don't worry about that.

20:05.520 --> 20:09.980
It will take a while for Yuigarde
to get his power back.

20:09.980 --> 20:13.230
The peaceful time will continue
until that time.

20:14.900 --> 20:18.610
Long live the Maiden Queen!

20:18.610 --> 20:20.280
First Princess!

20:20.280 --> 20:22.660
Long live the Maiden Queen!

20:27.750 --> 20:29.370
Maiden Queen.

20:29.750 --> 20:31.630
Have you been able to locate my father?

20:31.630 --> 20:33.300
Not yet.

20:33.300 --> 20:40.140
He escaped in fear that his vile deeds
behind the scenes would come to light.

20:40.140 --> 20:42.550
He's so pathetic.

20:42.550 --> 20:44.180
Please continue the search.

20:44.180 --> 20:44.970
Yes.

20:45.390 --> 20:49.560
We cannot waste the chance
that Sir Flio has given to us.

20:50.020 --> 20:53.060
I will surely restore this country.

20:54.860 --> 20:56.690
Where did he go?

20:56.690 --> 20:58.450
He must not gone far.

20:58.450 --> 20:59.650
Search for him!

21:01.660 --> 21:04.700
It's great that we were able to
escape from the hot springs,

21:04.700 --> 21:08.290
but we're just running away
all the time, aren't we?

21:08.290 --> 21:09.250
Don't cry!

21:09.250 --> 21:14.130
The time will surely come
when I will be welcomed as the Hero!

21:14.130 --> 21:15.050
Okay.

21:15.050 --> 21:17.510
I won't let this end like this!

21:18.300 --> 21:21.340
Everyone! The dinner is ready!

21:22.550 --> 21:25.890
I came to this world alone.

21:26.430 --> 21:29.100
At first, I just had to survive.

21:29.100 --> 21:32.100
Now I have friends and a dream.

21:32.100 --> 21:33.480
And that is...

21:34.020 --> 21:35.440
Rys.

21:35.440 --> 21:37.190
Yes, my dear?

21:37.580 --> 21:41.280
One day, when I open my own store,
let's sell the sweets you make.

21:41.700 --> 21:45.000
I'm confident in my baked sweets.

21:45.000 --> 21:47.870
I'll have Barilossa help me
with the cakes.

21:48.330 --> 21:51.460
Let's add the vegetables
that Blossom grows.

21:51.830 --> 21:53.830
That's a great idea!

21:53.830 --> 21:55.790
And I can make lunch boxes
with vegetables.

21:55.790 --> 21:57.750
That's a good idea too.

21:57.750 --> 21:59.970
Our dreams are expanding.

23:40.440 --> 23:43.690
Since this is the last episode,
we will award the person who did the best!

23:43.690 --> 23:44.490
I wonder who.

23:44.490 --> 23:46.150
It must be my dear husband.

23:46.150 --> 23:47.160
The award goes to...

23:47.160 --> 23:48.570
The Golden-Haired Hero!

23:48.570 --> 23:50.450
He does his best to make this show exciting!

23:50.450 --> 23:52.700
Then I'll be the main protagonist of
the second sea—

23:52.700 --> 23:54.070
It's already over, you know?

23:54.070 --> 23:55.330
Hurry up with the greetings!

23:55.330 --> 23:56.540
Huh? What? Wait!

23:56.540 --> 23:57.000
Ready?

23:57.000 --> 23:57.670
THANK YOU FOR WATCHING!
Ready?

23:57.670 --> 24:00.000
THANK YOU FOR WATCHING!
We hope to see you again!
